<<if change_person("Thisle", "Happy")>>//you need if for it to work :(
<<endif>>
<<trigger_talk>>
Thistle: Good morning attendant! As it is your first day here, Arthur wanted me to tell you about the “Report Phishing” stamp on your desk. 
<<set_mood "Neutral">>
<<trigger_talk>>
Thistle: We have had a few incidents lately with seal thefts and dangerous spells originating from scrolls.
<<trigger_talk>>
Thistle: If you see anything concerning, please seal the scroll using the stamp and fill out a report form checking the suspicious signs.
<<set_mood "Happy">>
<<trigger_talk>>
Thistle: I’ll collect them at the end of the day and hand them to Arthur, ok? 
<<set_mood "Neutral">>
<<trigger_talk>>
Thistle: Ah, yes! And remember to check addresses, links and THINK. That’s what Cressida always hounds Gwendolen about anyway!
<<end_of_it>>
